{"id":"hazar-enan","name":"Hazar-Enan","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:hazar-enan"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Hazar-enan","text":"Village of fountains, a place on the north-east frontier of Palestine (Num. 34:9, 10). Some have identified it with Ayan ed-Dara in the heart of the central chain of Anti-Libanus. More probably, however, it has been identified with Kuryetein, about 60 miles east-north-east of Damascus. (Comp. Ezek. 47:17; 48:1.)"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1366","lemma":"גְּבוּל","xlit":"gᵉbûwl","gloss":"a cord","kjv":"border, bound, coast, great","count":4,"share":1},{"strong":"H6828","lemma":"צָפוֹן","xlit":"tsâphôwn","gloss":"hidden","kjv":"north","count":3,"share":0.75}],"verses":["Num.34.9","Num.34.10","Ezek.47.17","Ezek.48.1"],"related":[{"id":"ataroth","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"beth-shemesh","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"dan","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"ekron","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"geshur","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"hamath","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"}],"works":[]}
